{"resource":{"id":"go-practice-questions","title":"Go \u2014 Practice Questions","category":"Programming","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"31 min","pages":21,"lastUpdated":"September 2026","tags":["Programming","Go","Concurrency"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461749280684-dccba630e2f6?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"A structured Go practice workbook with 350+ questions \u2014 MCQs, fill-in-the-blanks, debugging, output prediction, concurrency, and mini-project prompts."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"s1","label":"1. MCQs \u2014 Fundamentals"},{"id":"s2","label":"2. Fill in the Blanks"},{"id":"s3","label":"3. Debugging Exercises"},{"id":"s4","label":"4. Output Prediction"},{"id":"s5","label":"5. Coding Challenges"},{"id":"s6","label":"6. Concurrency Problems"},{"id":"s7","label":"7. Mini Projects"},{"id":"s8","label":"8. Scenario Questions"},{"id":"s9","label":"9. Self Assessment"},{"id":"review","label":"Practice Review"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQ"},{"id":"glossary","label":"Glossary"},{"id":"references","label":"References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"Go \u2014 Answer Key","tag":"Programming","time":"25 min"},{"title":"Go \u2014 Interview Questions","tag":"Programming","time":"26 min"},{"title":"Go \u2014 Sample Exercises","tag":"Programming","time":"22 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Practice 350+ Go questions across every core topic.</li>\n          <li>Build muscle memory for idiomatic patterns.</li>\n          <li>Sharpen debugging skills with intentionally broken snippets.</li>\n          <li>Ship 3 mini-projects to consolidate learning.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"/><path d=\"M9 18h6\"/><path d=\"M10 22h4\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Use with the Answer Key</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">Solve first, then check the companion Answer Key \u2014 never the other way around.</div></div></div></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s1\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">1. MCQs \u2014 Fundamentals</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ol class=\"list-decimal space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm\">\n          <li>Which keyword launches a goroutine? <strong>(a)</strong> async <strong>(b)</strong> go <strong>(c)</strong> spawn <strong>(d)</strong> thread</li>\n          <li>Zero value of a bool is: <strong>(a)</strong> nil <strong>(b)</strong> 0 <strong>(c)</strong> false <strong>(d)</strong> undefined</li>\n          <li>Which package handles JSON? <strong>(a)</strong> encoding/json <strong>(b)</strong> json/std <strong>(c)</strong> data/json <strong>(d)</strong> fmt/json</li>\n          <li>Slice header contains: <strong>(a)</strong> ptr, len, cap <strong>(b)</strong> ptr, size <strong>(c)</strong> only len <strong>(d)</strong> only cap</li>\n          <li>Which primitive coordinates goroutines with data? <strong>(a)</strong> mutex <strong>(b)</strong> channel <strong>(c)</strong> semaphore <strong>(d)</strong> event</li>\n        </ol>\n        <p class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">\u202650 more MCQs continue in the printable version, grouped by chapter.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s2\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">2. Fill in the Blanks</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ol class=\"list-decimal space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm\">\n          <li>To declare a package, start the file with <code>______ main</code>.</li>\n          <li>The short variable declaration operator is <code>______</code>.</li>\n          <li>To wait for goroutines, use <code>sync.______</code>.</li>\n          <li>To cancel a request, pass a <code>context.______</code>.</li>\n          <li>To iterate over a map use the <code>______</code> keyword.</li>\n        </ol>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s3\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">3. Debugging Exercises</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Find and fix the bug in each snippet.</p>\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>// #1 \u2014 deadlock?\nch := make(chan int)\nch &lt;- 1\nfmt.Println(&lt;-ch)</code></pre></div>\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>// #2 \u2014 race?\nvar count int\nfor i := 0; i &lt; 100; i++ { go func(){ count++ }() }</code></pre></div>\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>// #3 \u2014 nil dereference?\nvar m map[string]int\nm[&quot;a&quot;] = 1</code></pre></div>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517694712202-14dd9538aa97?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 \u2014 Debugging workflow: reproduce \u2192 isolate \u2192 hypothesise \u2192 fix \u2192 cover with a test.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s4\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">4. Output Prediction</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>s := []int{1, 2, 3}\nt := s\nt[0] = 99\nfmt.Println(s[0]) // ?</code></pre></div>\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>for i, v := range []string{&quot;a&quot;,&quot;b&quot;,&quot;c&quot;} { go func(){ fmt.Println(i, v) }() }</code></pre></div>\n        <p class=\"text-sm\">Predict the output before running. Explain <em>why</em>, not just <em>what</em>.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s5\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">5. Coding Challenges</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ol class=\"list-decimal space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm\">\n          <li>Reverse a string preserving Unicode.</li>\n          <li>Count word frequencies from a large file efficiently.</li>\n          <li>Detect a cycle in a linked list.</li>\n          <li>Merge two sorted slices in O(n+m).</li>\n          <li>Implement an LRU cache with a map + doubly linked list.</li>\n        </ol>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s6\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">6. Concurrency Problems</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ol class=\"list-decimal space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm\">\n          <li>Bounded worker pool consuming from a channel.</li>\n          <li>Fan-out / fan-in for HTTP fetches.</li>\n          <li>Rate limiter using time.Tick.</li>\n          <li>Graceful shutdown of a server with context.</li>\n          <li>Race-free counter using sync/atomic.</li>\n        </ol>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544197150-b99a580bb7a8?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 2 \u2014 Concurrent pipeline: source \u2192 workers \u2192 sink, coordinated with channels and context.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s7\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">7. Mini Projects</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>URL shortener CLI + REST API.</li>\n          <li>Log tailer with concurrent regex filters.</li>\n          <li>Chat server with rooms over WebSockets.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s8\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">8. Scenario Questions</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ol class=\"list-decimal space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm\">\n          <li>Your service leaks memory in production \u2014 how do you triage?</li>\n          <li>A downstream dependency is slow \u2014 implement retries with backoff.</li>\n          <li>Traffic spikes 10\u00d7 \u2014 where do you look for bottlenecks?</li>\n        </ol>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s9\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">9. Self Assessment</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Score yourself weekly out of 100. Below 60 \u2192 revisit the chapter. 60\u201380 \u2192 practice more. 80+ \u2192 move on.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"review\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Practice Review</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Chapter Score</h3>\n        <p>Track score per chapter to identify weakest concepts.</p>\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">Progress Tracker</h3>\n        <p>Complete 20 questions per day for 3 weeks to finish the workbook.</p>\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">Coding Checklist</h3>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>\u2705 All mini-projects shipped.</li>\n          <li>\u2705 Every debugging exercise reproduced and fixed.</li>\n          <li>\u2705 Race detector clean on concurrency solutions.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQ</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Are answers included?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">No \u2014 the companion Answer Key resource has them.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Can I skip debugging exercises?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Debugging is the most transferable skill \u2014 do them.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"glossary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Glossary</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><strong>MCQ</strong> \u2014 multiple-choice question.</li>\n          <li><strong>Deadlock</strong> \u2014 two goroutines waiting on each other forever.</li>\n          <li><strong>Backoff</strong> \u2014 increasing delay between retries.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">\n          Practice materials for self-study. Verify solutions with the Answer Key and official\n          documentation. Trademarks belong to their respective owners.\n        </p>\n      </div></section>"}